  "metadata": {
    "title": "VA Benefits For Family And Caregivers | Veterans Affairs",
    "description": "As the spouse or dependent child of a Veteran or service member, you may qualify for certain benefits, including healthcare, life insurance, or money for school. As the survivor of a Veteran or service member, you may qualify for added benefits, including help with burial costs and survivor compensation. If you’re caring for a Veteran, you may also be eligible for support to help you better care for the Veteran—and for yourself. Find out which benefits you may qualify for and how to get them.",
